{"ref":"BDB, סִיר²","hw":"סִיר²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">סִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>thorn, hook (</strong>𝔗 <em>id.;</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">סירם</span> in Sab. n.pr. Hom<sup>ZMG xivi (1892), 532</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">סִירִיס</span>, <em>thorns</em>, sign of desolation <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.13\">Is 34:13</a>, a barrier <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:8\" href=\"/Hosea.2.8\">Ho 2:8</a>, on <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:10\" href=\"/Nahum.1.10\">Na 1:10</a> v. [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, סָבַךְ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_סָבַךְ\">סָבַךְ</a>]; <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּקוֹל הַסּ׳ תַּחַת הַסִּיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.6\">Ec 7:6</a> <em>as the sound of thorns</em> (crackling as they burn) <em>under the pot</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">סִירוֹת</span> <em>hooks</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:2\" href=\"/Amos.4.2\">Am 4:2</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, דּוּגָה\" href=\"/BDB,_דּוּגָה\", dir=\"rtl\">בּוּגָה</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, דָּגָה\" href=\"/BDB,_דָּגָה\", dir=\"rtl\">דגה</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צִנּוֹת</span>; on realtion of meanings v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חוֹחַ\" href=\"/BDB,_חוֹחַ\", dir=\"rtl\">חוֹחַ</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, צֵן²\" href=\"/BDB,_צֵן²\", dir=\"rtl\">צֵן</a>).","next":"BDB, סָךְ","prev":"BDB, סִיר"}